{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/a5b70d4507bc5cc7d2ac15fea6f492aa.avif?t=1757695738\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span><strong>GRID BASED</strong>\u00a0<strong>PLACEMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are able to place dwarfs on the paths and buildings on the sides of paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ARMY</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards to play before the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIT LEVELS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarfs level up automatically by living &amp; dealing damage &amp; healing, enemies level up by wave and you need to upgrade your buildings to get more resources\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VILLAGE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to work on the &quot;Dwarven Village&quot; by placing &amp; repairing &amp; upgrading towers or houses like item shop or spell house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GETTING HELP FROM DIFFERENT RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you repair the watchtower in the village you are able to select one race and get help from them by being able to place them on paths &amp; being able to place special towers that belongs to that race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCREASE YOUR STATS BY BUYING &amp; UPGRADING TOWERS\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase your stats by buying &amp; upgrading towers &amp; statues \u00a0or with cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ITEM &amp; CURSE SHOP</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get items and curse cards to get some buffs (some rebuffs when you get curse) for overall stats or specific for units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526560?t=1757695738","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/e385a131ba6bae0119d9afa78965ced831ba1a71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757695738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/7d91c95a7a4e2f59b967decc7eb00cff42d76d40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757695738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/7d91c95a7a4e2f59b967decc7eb00cff42d76d40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757695738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/extras/a5b70d4507bc5cc7d2ac15fea6f492aa.avif?t=1757695738\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span><strong>GRID BASED</strong>\u00a0<strong>PLACEMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are able to place dwarfs on the paths and buildings on the sides of paths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ARMY</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards to play before the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIT LEVELS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarfs level up automatically by living &amp; dealing damage &amp; healing, enemies level up by wave and you need to upgrade your buildings to get more resources\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VILLAGE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to work on the &quot;Dwarven Village&quot; by placing &amp; repairing &amp; upgrading towers or houses like item shop or spell house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GETTING HELP FROM DIFFERENT RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you repair the watchtower in the village you are able to select one race and get help from them by being able to place them on paths &amp; being able to place special towers that belongs to that race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCREASE YOUR STATS BY BUYING &amp; UPGRADING TOWERS\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase your stats by buying &amp; upgrading towers &amp; statues \u00a0or with cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ITEM &amp; CURSE SHOP</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get items and curse cards to get some buffs (some rebuffs when you get curse) for overall stats or specific for units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ahmet Agun T\u00fcylo\u011flu"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/f4b559d197260a0d3b3c3b49233c2040dd6d2ebd/header.jpg?t=1757695738","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257196906,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196906/movie480.mp4?t=1757695732","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/